  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DGI Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union (EU) and several member states have started a Joint Initiative on Twin Digital and Green Transition. This falls under the Team Europe initiative of the D4D Hub. Its aim is to strengthen digital green and circular entrepreneurship &amp; innovation across partner countries and regions. The Netherlands is contributing to this Joint Initiative with a parallel knowledge action. This entails conducting research to contribute to the knowledge base on the Twin Digital and green transition in Africa and to come up with recommendations on stimulating twin transitions at project, policy and intervention levels. The research will be conducted in Senegal, Kenya and Mozambique.</narrative>
  </description>
